":"And those who believed and did righteous deeds will be admitted to gardens beneath which rivers flow, abiding eternally therein by permission of their Lord; and their greeting therein will be, \"Peace!\"","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"14:24","t":"Have you not considered how Allāh presents an example, [making] a good word like a good tree, whose root is firmly fixed and its branches [high] in the sky?","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":24,"sd":null}],"juz":13,"hizb":26,"surahs":[14],"sajdah":false}